    <section class="featured-programs" style="background-image: url('/images/featured-programs-bg.svg');">
        <div class="container">
                        <div class="program-card">
                                                <div class="thumbnail">
                    <img src="https://stdidrihcaprod.blob.core.windows.net/rihca/images/coding-image.png" alt="" />
                </div>
                                <div class="program-text">
                    <h3 class="headline">
                        RIHCA Releases Request for Proposals
                    </h3>
                    <h4 class="subhead">
                        Seeking Coding Consultant Services for the Rural Health Transformation Program (RHTP)
                    </h4>
                    <p class="description">
                        RIHCA is seeking proposals from qualified vendors to provide coding consultant services that support Rhode Island’s Community Health Centers in advancing value based care through improved documentation, coding accuracy and related technical support under the Rural Health Transformation Program.
                    </p>
                    <div class="button">
                        <p>Click <a href="https://stdidrihcaprod.blob.core.windows.net/rihca/documents/RIHCA-RHTP_Coding-Consultant-Services_Request-for-Proposals_16OCT26_FINAL.pdf">HERE</a> to view the RFP</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                        <div class="program-card">
                                                <div class="thumbnail">
                    <img src="https://stdidrihcaprod.blob.core.windows.net/rihca/images/finance.png" alt="" />
                </div>
                                <div class="program-text">
                    <h3 class="headline">
                        RIHCA Releases Request for Proposals
                    </h3>
                    <h4 class="subhead">
                        Seeking Finance Manager for the Rural Health Transformation Program
                    </h4>
                    <p class="description">
                        RIHCA is seeking proposals from qualified vendors to provide Finance Manager services to support the financial, fiscal and administrative requirements of the Rural Health Transformation Program (RHTP) and other programmatic efforts within RIHCA.
                    </p>
                    <div class="button">
                        <p>Click <a href="https://stdidrihcaprod.blob.core.windows.net/rihca/documents/RIHCA_Finance-Manager_RHTP_Request-for-Proposals_29SEP26.pdf">HERE</a> to view the RFP</p><p>Click <a href="https://stdidrihcaprod.blob.core.windows.net/rihca/documents/Responses-Finance-Manager.pdf">HERE</a> to view submitted questions and answers</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                        <div class="program-card">
                                                <div class="thumbnail">
                    <img src="https://stdidrihcaprod.blob.core.windows.net/rihca/images/application.jpg" alt="" />
                </div>
                                <div class="program-text">
                    <h3 class="headline">
                        Statewide Assister Network Services
                    </h3>
                    <h4 class="subhead">
                        Get more information on how your organization can get certified to provide application assistance
                    </h4>
                    <p class="description">
                        Your agency has the opportunity to become part of a volunteer program providing unpaid, in-person application assistance to consumers who want to enroll in health insurance.
                    </p>
                    <div class="button">
                        <p><a href="https://rihca.org/about/about-rihca">More about the SANS Program</a><br /></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                        <div class="program-card">
                                                <div class="thumbnail">
                    <img src="https://stdidrihcaprod.blob.core.windows.net/rihca/banners/In-the.png" alt="" />
                </div>
                                <div class="program-text">
                    <h3 class="headline">
                        In the Spotlight
                    </h3>
                    <h4 class="subhead">
                        Highlighting RIHCA&#039;s Member Community Health Centers and Partner Organizations
                    </h4>
                    <p class="description">
                        Thundermist Health Center’s Jess Null Recognized as one of PBN&#039;s 40 under 40 Honorees!
                    </p>
                    <div class="button">
                        <p>Click <a href="https://stdidrihcaprod.blob.core.windows.net/rihca/documents/Congratulations-to-Jess-Null.pdf">HERE</a> to read more</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                    </div>
    </section>

    
</main>

